OL,3,GNEWSAAI helps turn old milk bottles
OL,4,Ainto new ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence is being used
OL,7,Fto help turn old milk bottles into new
OL,8,Fones and they can be back in your
OL,9,Ffridge "within two weeks".
OL,11,FRecycling site Biffa Polymers in Redcar
OL,12,Fuses the technology to analyse
OL,13,Fmaterials moving along conveyor belts
OL,14,Fat a speed and scale that "would be
OL,15,Fdifficult for people to match".
OL,17,FManaging director James McLeary, said
OL,18,FAI could identify different types of
OL,19,Fplastic using optical and infra-red
OL,20,Fscanning, as well as image analysis.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
