OL,3,GNEWSAAI helps turn old milk bottles
OL,4,Ainto new ones
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he said the plant still relied on a
OL,7,Fworkforce of about 200 people who are
OL,8,Ffreed up by AI to ensure products are
OL,9,Fof the right quality, rather than
OL,10,F"spending their time doing tedious
OL,11,Ftasks".
